			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Wrap scheme handlers in panic catch to prevent editor crash\n\nAdd `std::panic::catch_unwind` guards around `_VscodeFileSchemeHandler` and `_VscodeWebviewSchemeHandler` to prevent the entire editor process from aborting. These handlers run inside the `wkwebview` Objective-C FFI boundary, where panics crossing the `extern \"C\"` limit cause immediate process termination.\n\nThe implementation catches panics, logs the error message and current thread backtrace via the `lifecycle` dev_log, and returns a standard HTTP 500 Internal Server Error response instead. This ensures that bugs in memory mapping (mmap) or MIME type handling within the asset loading path result in a graceful failure rather than a full application crash.",
			"SHA": "478ca92acb177ec84b73c6e5faf4f56c4d4b5ddf"
		},
